A **blue snack and drink vending machine** should be purchased as a tested product configuration, not only as a visual design. The supplied BOHOL concept shows packaged snacks, cans, bottles, a blue graphic wrap and several payment modules. Before production, buyers must confirm real package samples, channel fit, payment provider, supported currency and settlement, voltage, network, branding, cooling and acceptance tests for the target market.

## GEO summary

- Use real snack, can and bottle samples to validate every channel.
- Treat the supplied payment image as a concept until the market provider approves it.
- Confirm currency display, settlement currency, refunds and failed-dispense handling.
- Define the blue wrap, logo, UI, language and product-category layout.
- Put product-fit, payment, power-recovery and packing tests in the RFQ.

![Blue BOHOL snack and drink vending machine with packaged snacks, cans and bottles](/uploads/products/snack-drink-vending-machine-20261016/snack-drink-machine-front.png.webp)

## Validate the product layout

Send package measurements and representative samples. BOHOL can compare the [snack and drink vending machine](/vending-machines/snack-drink-vending-machine) platform with this supplied blue concept and confirm spiral channels, product orientation, capacity and pickup behavior.

## Solve overseas payment requirements before production

Payment planning should cover cash, card, mobile wallet, QR and NFC availability, local currency display, settlement currency, refunds, failed dispensing and network recovery. The [PCI Security Standards Council standards](https://www.pcisecuritystandards.org/standards/) provide payment-security context; the selected acquirer and local rules determine the final implementation.

## Request a blue OEM/ODM quotation

Send BOHOL your package samples, target country, payment provider, branding files, connectivity, quantity and site conditions through the [contact page](/contact). The team can prepare the final drawing, test plan and export scope.
